      "writtenOn": "2019-10-31T05:59:59Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "default and primary mean the apex type that is installed when the apex module name is added to PRODUCT_PACKAGES.\nI think default and primary has same mean in Jooyung\u0027s comment.\n\nThe reason for knowing primary is related to suffix. The primary variant has the same module name as the apex name and must be installed in that partition (system, product or vendor) without any additional suffixes.",
